1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
How to connect with CloseSight

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
How to connect with CloseSight

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
First, you need to log in to CloseSight account in CloseSight.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Open the CloseSight app and click on CloseTool庫 in the upper right corner.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Or press the Y button to open CloseTool庫.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
In the option card on the top of the tool庫, switch to CloseSight.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Click on Log in and jump to the CloseSight Login page.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Enter your CloseSight account and password.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Click on Log in and close the page.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Go back to the CloseTool app and check the CloseSight assets in the tool庫 window.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The way the tool庫 is operated is similar to the page.

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
In the left-hand layer, you can switch to different groups.

13
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
In the layer bar, select the corresponding workspace.

14
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Double-click to open the selected file.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
After opening, we can close the tool庫.

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Click on the X or press the shortcut key to close it.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,000
In CloseTool,

18
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
we can change the design of the clothing.

19
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
After the design is complete, open the tool庫.

20
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Find the appropriate fabric from the CloseSight company resource library.

21
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Double-click to download.

22
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Apply the fabric to the clothing.

23
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Open the tool庫.

24
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
In the option card on the top of the tool庫, select Connect.

25
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
In the left-hand selection bar, select virtual model.

26
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Here we can change the model's shoes, hairstyle, etc.

27
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Select the type of hair.

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Select gender and age as female.

29
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,000
The compatibility is clone female.

30
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The price is free.

31
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
After finding the appropriate material, double-click to change the model's hairstyle.

32
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Now switch the type to shoes.

33
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Other settings remain unchanged.

34
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Double-click to change model shoes.

35
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Switch the type to posture.

36
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Other settings remain unchanged.

37
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Double-click to change model posture.

38
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,000
In the left-hand selection bar, switch from virtual model to scene.

39
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,000
The price is still free.

40
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Double-click to increase the scene.

41
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
After completion, close the tool庫.

42
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
When all the files are completed,

43
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:14,000
upload this file to CloseSight.

44
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,000
In the main menu, select CloseSight.

45
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,000
You can choose to upload new content or a new version.

46
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:26,000
In the CloseSight web page, you can choose different groups.

47
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Choose an hour or two.

48
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Select Workroom, and click Next to finish uploading.

49
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:39,000
If you have other content to watch,

50
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:44,000
choose YouTube, YouTube Live, or PodCast.

51
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,000
If you have other content to watch,

52
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,000
choose YouTube Live, or PodCast.

53
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Click Next and wait until the end.

54
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Click Next to see the uploaded video.

